Based on Zed
------------

Unaligned IDE is a modified version (a fork) of the Zed editor.

    Zed
    Copyright 2022 - 2025 Zed Industries, Inc.
    https://github.com/zed-industries/zed

Zed is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later (the application) and Apache-2.0 (GPUI
and other crates). This fork keeps both licences on the code they cover.

Fork point: upstream commit 3e23a0c48201a9cc34ad4a3a4225910247de41f4
(2026-11-12), which carries the version number 1.30.0.

Modified by the Unaligned IDE contributors since 2026. The history of this
repository after the fork point is the record of the changes.

"Zed" is the name of the upstream project. It appears here and in the product
only to say where the code comes from. Unaligned IDE is a separate project and
is not presented as Zed.


Licences in this repository
---------------------------

Each crate's Cargo.toml says which licence covers it in its `license` field,
and each crate directory carries a LICENSE-GPL or LICENSE-APACHE link.

  GPL-3.0-or-later   the application: editor, workspace, project, agent, the
                     user interface crates, and everything this fork added
                     (among others the `branding` crate and the Unaligned
                     provider).
  Apache-2.0         GPUI and its platform layers, and the support crates that
                     upstream publishes under that licence (among others
                     `util`, `collections`, `sum_tree`, `refineable`,
                     `http_client`, `extension_api`).

Nine upstream manifests have no `license` field (`dev_container`, `grammars`,
`language_core`, `tabular_data_preview`, the four `*_benchmarks` crates and
`tooling/lints`). This fork did not change that.


Files changed in Apache-2.0 crates
----------------------------------

The Apache License, section 4(b), asks that changed files say so. Compared
with the fork point, this fork changed the following files of Apache-2.0
crates (state of 2026-11-12):

  crates/gpui/src/style.rs
      A process-wide scale for the named corner radii
      (`set_corner_radius_scale`, `corner_radius_scale`, `scaled_radius`).

  crates/gpui_macros/src/styles.rs
      The named radii (`rounded_xs` to `rounded_3xl`) go through
      `scaled_radius`.

  crates/http_client/src/http_client.rs
      URLs of Zed's hosted services are refused unless the environment
      variable ZED_SERVER_URL is set (`zed_hosted_services_enabled`,
      `ZED_CLOUD_UNAVAILABLE_MESSAGE`, `is_fake`).

  crates/cloud_api_client/src/cloud_api_client.rs
      The three feedback calls fail without sending a request.

  crates/oauth_callback_server/src/oauth_callback_server.rs
      The page shown in the browser after a sign-in names no product.

  crates/util/src/util.rs
      Messages and helper names use the product's own name and identifiers.

  crates/extension_suggest/src/extension_suggest.rs
      Wording and links no longer refer to Zed's hosted services.

To list them again after later changes (run from the repository root):

    git diff --stat 3e23a0c482 -- $(grep -rl --include=Cargo.toml \
        '^license = "Apache-2.0"' crates extensions tooling | xargs -n1 dirname)


