Bundled icons
-------------

Most interface icons in assets/icons come from upstream. They include icons of
the Lucide set (ISC License; portions from Feather, MIT License): see
assets/icons/LICENSES. The product's mark and its application icons are
generated from the Unaligned logo by script/unaligned/make-icons.


Dependencies
------------

The licences of the Rust dependencies are not listed here. They are collected
when the application is packaged: script/generate-licenses (Linux, macOS) and
script/generate-licenses.ps1 (Windows) write assets/licenses.md, which holds
the theme, icon and font licences above followed by the licence of every
dependency. The application shows that file, with the text of the GNU General
Public License, on its licences page.
